# Searchdrone safety parameters for real flight (ArduCopter Copter-4.7.1).
# Loaded after searchdrone-safety.parm; it changes only the rows that differ from the
# simulator. A real flight may only start with a physical RC transmitter that is on and
# heard by the flight controller: the RC transmitter goes before everything.
# Format: NAME VALUE.

# --- RC transmitter required ------------------------------------------------------------
ARMING_SKIPCHK 0         # every arming check on, the RC check (bit 6) included
FS_THR_ENABLE 4          # RC link lost in the air -> SmartRTL, else RTL

# --- position source switch --------------------------------------------------------------
RC8_OPTION 90            # the pilot's 3-position switch: GPS / no GPS / no GPS
